            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It seems that <https://github.com/vim/vim/commit/75ab590f8504a8912ca0b8c58f6b897bb7a34f07> incorrectly changed the meaning of the docs. Before that this came after \"for the filetypedetect group\".",
